# MARHALA 2 — PRIMARY AUR SECONDARY KI FINAL APPROVED STRUCTURE

Neeche di gayi structure current approved requirement hai. Isay actual code, scheduling, topic-selection logic aur Blogger API calls mein follow karein.

## Primary Marketing — “Hum kya kar rahe hain?”

Maqsad: Apni services, Web App, courses, features, tools, tutorials, use cases aur YouTube channel ko seedha explain aur promote karna.

### Primary Blog 1 — Subah

- Blogger Post publish hogi.
- Topic AI khud select karega.
- Topic actual Web App, service, feature, course, learning resource ya useful use case se relevant ho.
- Article detailed, useful aur professional ho.

### Primary Blog 2 — Dopahar

- Blogger Post publish hogi.
- AI aik naya aur meaningfully different topic select karega.
- Subah wale topic ki copy, sirf title badla hua article ya unnecessary repetition nahin honi chahiye.

### Primary Blog 3 — Shaam

- Blogger Post lazman us din ke selected, actual YouTube Short par based hogi.
- Short ka asal title, description, thumbnail, Shorts URL aur embedded video sahi hon.
- Article mein usi Short ki tafseeli explanation, relevant context, useful examples aur Web App/YouTube ke relevant links hon.
- Kisi doosri video ka title, thumbnail, ID ya embed istemal nahin hona chahiye.

## Secondary Marketing — “Hum public ko kya value de rahe hain?”

Maqsad: Pehle public ko useful guides, tips, practical solutions, educational material aur how-to content dena, phir naturally relevant Primary Blog, Web App ya YouTube channel ki taraf guide karna.

### Secondary Page 1 — Subah

Permanent Blogger Static Page hogi. Iska topic Primary Blog 1 se relevant hoga, lekin yeh us Post ki copy nahin hogi. Reader ko additional practical value milni chahiye.

### Secondary Page 2 — Dopahar

Permanent Blogger Static Page hogi. Yeh Primary Blog 2 se relevant hogi, magar apni unique explanation, guide, examples ya solutions ke saath.

### Secondary Page 3 — Shaam

Permanent Blogger Static Page hogi. Yeh Primary Blog 3 ke actual YouTube Short ke topic se relevant additional value provide karegi. Isay Primary Post ka duplicate version na banayein.

## Posts aur Pages ka farq kabhi khatam nahin hona chahiye

Primary ke tamam 3 outputs Blogger **Posts** honge.

Secondary ke tamam 3 outputs Blogger ki permanent **Static Pages** hongi, Blog Posts nahin.

Secondary ke liye Pages wala API/resource hi istemal karein. Har published Page ka apna Page ID, URL aur history record ho.

Naye topic ke liye purani Page ko sirf is liye overwrite na karein ke woh wahi morning, afternoon ya evening slot tha. Duplicate topic/page milne par pehle uski identity aur history inspect karein.

Published Static Pages ko automatically delete, unpublish ya be-wajah overwrite na karein.

## Corresponding Primary Post aur Secondary Page ka rabta

Har din ki mapping yeh hogi:

- Primary Blog 1 → Secondary Page 1.
- Primary Blog 2 → Secondary Page 2.
- Primary Blog 3 → Secondary Page 3.

Har Secondary Page apni relevant Primary Post ke successful publication ke taqreeban **60 se 120 minutes baad** publish honi chahiye.

Delay Primary Post ke actual successful publication time se calculate karein, sirf planned trigger time se nahin.

Agar Primary Post fail ho to uski Secondary Page ko bina corresponding Primary ke publish na karein. Retry ya recovery ke baad successful Primary publication ke mutabiq 60–120 minute ka gap maintain karein.

Har pair ka Primary Post ID/URL, Secondary Page ID/URL, topic identity, scheduled time aur actual publication time persistent record mein save ho.

