# MARHALA 3 — AUTONOMOUS TOPIC SELECTION AUR DUPLICATE TOPICS KA KHATMA

Mujhe roz manually topics select nahin karne. AI ko khud relevant topics select karke daily publishing chalani hai.

Har din total 6 distinct content topics ya clearly different topic angles hon. Morning, afternoon aur evening slots mein same topic repeat nahin hona chahiye.

Sirf title ya chand alfaaz badal kar aik hi topic ko unique kehna qabool nahin hai.

## Topic-selection system

Topic selection mein yeh cheezein use hon:

- Existing Web App ke actual features aur functions.
- Services, courses, tools aur tutorials.
- Users ke practical masail aur unke solutions.
- Useful educational topics, guides aur how-to material.
- Kids learning, Urdu/English, phonics, stories, activities aur relevant content.
- Topic ki previous publication/promotion history.
- Topic ka Primary ya Secondary purpose.
- Primary Blog 3 ke liye selected YouTube Short ka asal subject.

Primary Marketing app/service ko directly explain kare. Secondary Marketing pehle public ko independent useful value de aur phir relevant link ya CTA naturally include kare.

## Persistent history aur rotation

Topic history ko sirf temporary memory ya aik run ke variables mein na rakhein. Restart, trigger recreation, manual run ya failure se history reset nahin honi chahiye.

Har content ke liye persistent record maintain karein:

- Unique topic/content ID.
- Topic title aur normalized topic identity.
- Category aur related app feature.
- Daily slot aur destination blog.
- Resource type: Post ya Static Page.
- Actual selected YouTube Video ID, jahan applicable ho.
- Content identity/hash.
- Selection aur publishing history.
- Blogger Post/Page ID aur URL.
- Scheduled, execution aur publication timestamps.
- Status, failure reason, retry history aur cooldown information.

Same din ke chhay outputs mein topic duplication rokna hai. Previous days ki topics ko bhi history se compare karein taa-ke woh baar-baar select na hon.

Configurable cooldown aur rotation policy use karein. Never-promoted ya recently kam use hue relevant topics ko munasib priority mile.

Agar valid aur distinct topic available na ho to low-quality duplicate content publish karne ke bajaye reason log karein aur controlled retry/failure handling istemal karein.

Aik representative topic-selection aur history report actual implementation se generate karke dikhayein. Sirf hardcoded sample titles ki list ko autonomous rotation ka proof na kahein.

