Har Primary Post aur Secondary Static Page ka status, topic, resource type, publication ID/URL aur actual time.

### 5. YouTube catalog ka final result
Verified catalog ki asal count, chronology, relevant IDs aur unresolved differences.

### 6. Design verification
App Showcase image, logo, thumbnail, embed, footer aur reciprocal links ka live status.

### 7. Duplicate aur error-handling tests
Kaun se tests actual run huay aur unka result kya tha.

### 8. Triggers ka status
Kaun se managed triggers mojood, disabled ya ready hain. Production activation abhi hui hai ya nahin.

### 9. Baqi reh jane wale issues
Har unverified, blocked ya incomplete item aur uski exact wajah.

### 10. Final readiness
Project ko `READY`, `PARTIALLY READY` ya `NOT READY` ka status evidence ki bunyaad par dein. Sirf syntax pass, code present, ya pehle ke AI Studio claims ki bunyaad par `FULLY READY & PRODUCTION VERIFIED` na likhein.

